ion analyses H38-H41 strongly support persistence of the four accepted main associations after removing plausible co-occurring or related biology: SMARCA4 loss still gives a +0.777 SMARCA2 effect in ARID1A-intact lineages; TP53 loss still gives a +0.804 USP7 effect in KEAP1-intact lineages; MSI-high still gives a +0.772 WRN effect among high mutation-burden lineages; and KEAP1 loss still gives a +0.792 NFE2L2 effect in TP53-intact lineages. All intervals exclude zero and the 10% thresholds, and all cell counts satisfy the 20-per-cell rule. These acceptances are associations in this dataset only; they do not establish causality, mechanism, or generalizability beyond the supplied lung-lineage panel."
